    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ogwasatu n'omukaaga (36) nga kyabazinga Asa n'afuga Buyudaaya, kyabazinga Baasha owa Isiraeli yaalumba Buyudaaya. Yaazimba ekimante ekigumu okwezunguluza ekibuga Rama, ghalobe kubaagho ava mu Buyudaaya, waire ajaayo okutuuka ku kyabazinga waayo Asa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Asa yaatoola feeza ni zaabu mu iterekero ly'eisinzizo, ni mu iterekero erirye nga kyabazinga, yaamugheereza kyabazinga Benihadadi ow'e Siria, eyabanga mu Damasiko, ng'amukoba ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka tukole endagaano ey'enkolagana ey'aghalala, nga balata baife ye baakola. Bona eno, nkugheereiza feeza ni zaabu. Ja omenhegho endagaano yo ey'enkolagana ni kyabazinga Baasha owa Isiraeli, olwo abe ng'ali n'okutoola amagye ge mu kiketezo kyange.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benihadadi yaaganha kyabazinga Asa bye yamukoba. Yaatuma abaduumizi b'eigye lye okulumba ebibuga bya Isiraeli. Baagema ebibuga bino: Iyoni, ni Dani, ni Abeli Maimu, n'ebibuga bya Nafutali byonabyona ebyalimu amaterekero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga Baasha bwe yawulira ebigwiregho, yaalekera agho okuzimba ekimante ekigumu okwezunguluza ekibuga Rama, yaakomya agho omulimo ogwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga Asa yaatwala abantu ab'omu Buyudaaya boonaboona, baaja baatoola e Rama amabaale n'emiti, Baasha bye yali ali kuzimbisa. Asa yaabizimbisa ebibuga, Geba ni Mizipa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kiseera ekyo, omulanzi Hanani yaaja ye kyabazinga Asa owa Buyudaaya, yaamukoba ati: “Olw'okuba weesiga kyabazinga wa Siria, waaloba kwesiga Musengwa Katonda wo, eigye lya Isiraeli likweibyeku lyakulumukaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaethiopia n'Abalibiya tibaali igye inene inho, nga liri n'ebigaali eby'omu lutalo n'abavuzi b'embalaasi kamaala? Aye olw'okuba weesiga Musengwa Katonda, Musengwa Katonda oyo yaakuleetera okubaghangula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda abona mu nsi mwonamwona buli kiseera, asobole okugha amaani abo ab'emyoyo egimwesiga. Kale kino ky'okoze kya kisiru. Okuva n'olwaleero oidha kubanga mu kulwana ntalo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Asa yaasungughalira inho omulanzi oyo olw'ebyo bye yayogera, yaamugema yaamuta mu ikomera. Mu biseera n'ebirala ebyo, Asa oyo yaabisanga bubi n'obukambwe abantu abandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa bye yakola, okuva lwe yatoolera okufuga okutuuka lwe yakoma, byaghandiikibwa mu Kitabo ky'Ebyafaayo ebya bakyabazinga ba Buyudaaya n'aba Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka gwe ogwamakumi asatu n'omwenda (39) ku bwakyabazinga, yaalwala ebigere, yaaba bubi inho. Aye era, waire nga yalumizibwa inho, tiyasaba Musengwa Katonda kumuwonia. Yakozesanga bwa bayigha okumwidhandhaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Asa oyo yaafa mu mwaka gwe ogwamakumi ana n'omulala (41) ku bwakyabazinga, yeeyimba ku badhaadha be abaafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era yaaziikibwa mu magombe, mwene ge yeesimira mu lubaale, mu kyetebwa Ekibuga kya Daudi. Omulambo gwe baagulambaaza ku buliri obwidhwire obuwoowo obwa buli ngeri, obwatabulwa abakugu. Baakuma ekisiki eky'omuliro ekikologho, olw'okumulira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
